=== TARGET ===
- per-target control word (1x32 bit),
- mandatory to send with general seq (see 'general_protocol')
|---------------------------------------------------|
00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __
|---| |---|
PROTOCOL ID
- 0x0000 = general
- 0x0001 = target (you are here)
- 0x0002 = lighting
- 0x0110 = return
      |---|
      MODE
      - 0x0000 = halt target
      - 0x0001 = start moving target (with following config), keeps running until halted
      - 0x0002 = one-time target move to specific % (in terms of % hidden, 0 = visible, 100% = completely hidden, provided in final 4 bits)

__ __ __ __   00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __
              |---| ↑↑ ↑↑
              TARGET ID
              - 0-11 [0x0000, 0x1011] for each target (12)
              - 12 (0x1100) for all targets
                    || ||
                    TARGET MOVEMENT SPEED
                    - between 0-3 (25/50/75/100)
                    - used for transitions, moves and jukes
                       ||
                       RESERVED

__ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __
                            |---| |---|
                            TIME BETWEEN TARGET MOVE CYCLES
                            - seconds (i.e. 0x0101 = 5, 5s between cycles, max 15s)
                            - used for hold (hidden), exposed (visible) and jukes
                                  |---|
                                  TARGET JUKE %
                                  - decimal in 10% increments (i.e. 0x0011 = 3, or 30% of target move cycles are jukes)

__ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   00 00 00 00
                                          |---| |---|
                                          TARGET RANDOM SPEED CHANGE %
                                          - decimal in 10% increments (i.e. 0x0011 = 3, or 30%)
                                          - makes target move cycles a random speed between lvls 0-3, is checked every target move cycle
                                                |---|
                                                TARGET VISIBILITY
                                                - % hidden in 10% increments (0 = visible, 100% = completely hidden, i.e. 0x0011 = 3, or 30%)

